---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import CoverageLab from '../components/CoverageLab.astro';
---
<Layout title="Single-sensor coverage lab">
  <p class="eyebrow">Lab / DMS V0</p>
  <h1>What counts as sufficient coverage?</h1>
  <p class="lead">Explore how sensor position and an assumed circular radius change the estimated fraction of a bounded area that is geometrically covered.</p>
  <p><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}learn/01-engineering-intent/#exercise`}>Follow the Chapter 1 experiment</a>: predict a change, record the reference, find a passing configuration, then move it toward a corner with the radius unchanged.</p>
  <CoverageLab />
  <p><a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}learn/01-engineering-intent/#evidence`}>Interpret your results in Chapter 1 →</a> · <a href={`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}reference/`}>Inspect the sources</a></p>
</Layout>
